-------------------------------------------------------------------

If you only want to try the application:

Download the file:

app-debug.apk

Transfer it to your Android phone.

Install the APK and open the app.

--------------------------------------------------------------------

To run or modify the project:

Download or clone this repository.

Open Android Studio.

Click:

File → Open

Select the project folder:

SpeedBreakerDetector

Let Gradle sync finish.

Connect a phone or start an emulator.

Click Run.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
